Subject: [PATCH] docs: record patches 150 to 157 in the stack manifest

Phase P2 of the IndexedDB redesign: the storage bottle map obtained in
the backend, transactions created without waiting for the backend,
object stores and indexes addressed by id from a metadata snapshot, one
ordered result channel per connection with the request list in script,
the event target that IndexedDB's event parents keep in DOM dispatch,
string keys and names as UTF-16 code units, and key path identifiers
looked up by their code units. All seven edit upstream files and are
tier C; this bookkeeping entry is B, like the earlier ones. Entry 152
includes P2.2's crown fix for it, folded in before this commit, and
entries 152 to 154 the fixes of the P2 review, folded in later.

Validation: `uv run docs/ohos-sync/check_stack.py base/2026-11-09` passes.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; written by the agent, and the patches regenerated after the P2 review fixes)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
